        "props": {
          "label.text": "Behavior explanation",
          "text.value": "Behavior Explanation\nA Label is front-panel support text. Its visible content is text.value, while position, typography, and placement_bounds live on the .frog widget instance.\n\nThe Default Label SVG publishes root, placement_bounds, and text_surface only.",
